<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="tom-rice" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Tomato Rice Soup</title>

  <p>
    Ingredients
  </p>
  <tabular>
    <row>
      <cell>1 onion</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>3 cloves garlic</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 carrots</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
    <cell>2 stalks celery</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 quarts tomatoes with juice</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{8}</m> tsp cayenne pepper</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1+ tablespoon honey</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 cup brown rice</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>4 cups broth</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>1 \frac{1}{2}</m> tablespoons lemon juice</cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

  <p>Instructions
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p>
          Gently sautee onions, carrots celery, and garlic.  Cook patiently.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Meanwhile, cook rice most of the way.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Put vegetables in food processor, along with all or most of tomatoes, cayenne pepper, and honey.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Return everything to the pot and add rice and broth.  Bring to boil and simmer for 30 minutes.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Add lemon juice and serve.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </p>

  <p>
    Notes:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</section>